graph LR
    LDB["llm-d-benchmark<br/>(llmdbenchmark CLI + harness image)"]

    %% External libraries / tools
    LDB -->|K8s client| K8sPy["kubernetes ==35.0.0 / pykube-ng"]
    LDB -->|render + validate| Jinja["Jinja2 / PyYAML / pydantic 2.x"]
