        IM["InferenceMAX bench_serving"]
    end
    LDB -->|bundles| Harnesses

    %% Internal platform dependencies (system under test)
    LDB -->|resource lifecycle| K8sAPI["Kubernetes / OpenShift API"]
    LDB -->|helmfile deploy| MS["llm-d modelservice / llm-d-infra charts"]
    LDB -->|InferencePool + metrics| GAIE["Gateway API Inference Extension (EPP)"]
    LDB -->|HTTPRoute / Gateway| GW["Gateway API / Istio / agentgateway"]
    LDB -->|load target| VLLM["vLLM"]
    LDB -->|multi-node| LWS["LeaderWorkerSet"]
    LDB -->|autoscaling scenarios| KEDA["KEDA / Workload Variant Autoscaler"]
    LDB -->|CRD read + Deployment patch| FMA["Fast Model Actuation"]
    LDB -->|PodMonitor + Thanos query| Mon["OpenShift Monitoring / Thanos"]
    LDB -->|RoleBinding| SCC["OpenShift SCC restricted"]

    %% Context in RHOAI
    LLMISVC["KServe LLMInferenceService / llm-d stacks"] -.->|benchmarked by| LDB

    %% External services
    LDB -->|weights / tokenizers| HF["Hugging Face Hub"]
    LDB -->|results store| GCS["Google Cloud Storage"]
    LDB -.->|GCS proxy fallback| Prism["prism.llm-d.ai"]
    LDB -->|results upload| S3["Amazon S3"]
    LDB -.->|optional telemetry| Tel["Telemetry Receiver"]
    LDB -->|image publish| GHCR["ghcr.io/llm-d (GitHub Actions)"]

